    "detailed_description": "Graduation is coming. In other words, everything that makes your life great is about to disappear. But that won't stop you from making the most of senior year!<br><br>Does that mean making new friends (or lovers)? Buckling down on your passion project? Just chilling out? You decide!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 15-20 hours of story content!<br></li><li> Choose what to do after school, whether that be playing arcade games, hanging out at the maid cafe, or deepening relationships with your classmates!<br></li><li> Put your dev skills to the test with a variety of minigames and trivia questions!<br></li><li> A fully explorable world!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Amelia Lee</strong> - The perfect student, who can figure out anything except &quot;what kids are into these days.&quot;<br></li><li> <strong>Britney Summers</strong> - A lazy class clown who's only made it this far through sheer luck.<br></li><li> <strong>Chloe Suzuki</strong> - The level-headed girl who keeps everyone on track--or so she wants people to think.<br></li><li> <strong>Daniel Harrington</strong> - Son of the school principal, and he won't let you forget it.<br></li><li> And many more!</li></ul>",
